<title>USA: Elk River, Minn., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</title>
<headline>Elk River, Minn., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juran &amp; Moody, Inc. said it won $1.165 million of Elk River, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.815 percent.</p>
</text>
